WEBVTT

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.830
Maria Watches Over Us

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:16.140
Spreading a blank map wide open
Shiroi chizu ookiku hiroge

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:23.120
Let's go hide the treasure box
Takara-bako kakushi ni ikou

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:31.190
No need for coats or even hats
Kooto nante iranai boushi mo ne

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:38.830
Armed with just mechanical pencil lead
Shaapen no shin dake haite

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.240
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.140
Running through
kakenukeru

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.110
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:54.070
Our footprints mark the X
ashiato wa batsu-jirushi da yo

00:00:54.520 --> 00:01:01.090
Passing through the walls of the school
Kousha no kabe tsuki-nuke

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:09.330
We can go anywhere, there will be a path there
Dokonimo ikeru soko ni michi ga aru

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:16.530
The pleats of our skirts won't be disturbed
Sukaato no hida midare-nai

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:23.870
If it's a secret journey
Himitsu no tabi nara

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.020
The opening ceremony began.

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:50.600
Good morning, Yumi-sama.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.870
G-Good morning.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.600
I can't tear my eyes away from Toko-chan.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:09.360
The Masked Actress

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.360
Here you are, Yumi-sama.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.430
Thank you, Noriko-chan.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.530
Toko was in proper attendance today...

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.840
Acting as if nothing had
happened during Christmas...

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.770
Yeah, she did seem that way.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:31.870
I didn't know you were aware.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.120
We happened to run into her earlier.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.740
Right?

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:36.440
Yes.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.240
Um... And?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.080
That was all.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.420
We just greeted each other and then parted ways.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.050
I see.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:49.420
I feel like Toko-chan's become even
more guarded with her expressions.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:53.030
I wish she would open herself up a little more...

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.700
Okay, no more on this topic.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.370
The tea's going to grow bitter.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.370
Yes.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:06.710
It's delicious.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:07.850
Thank you very much.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:12.920
And now, I will announce
the schedule for January.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.860
Tomorrow, after school,
there will be an information session...

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.630
...for the election that will determine
next year's student council officers,

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.120
so all second-year students should participate.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.130
Oh, you can participate too, Noriko-chan.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.700
Oh, no, I will decline.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.130
First-year students can run too, you know.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.200
That's right. Just like Shimako did last year.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.710
If that happens, will it be a battle
between the White Rose sisters?

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.750
That would be pretty incredible.

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:47.320
Then after school tomorrow,
Yoshino-san and Yumi-san and I...

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:50.120
...will meet at the Election
Administration Commission Office.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.690
Will that be fine?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.460
Yes.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:54.400
Next, the school paper has approached us...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.830
Once the new student council is formed,
Next, the school paper has approached us...

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.230
my dear sister's graduation will be imminent...
Next, the school paper has approached us...

00:03:58.230 --> 00:03:59.300
my dear sister's graduation will be imminent...
...about doing a Valentine's Day event again...

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.540
...about doing a Valentine's Day event again...

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.760
...like last year.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.610
The next day, the information session was held...

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.940
...for the election to determine
next year's student council officers.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.980
Good luck in the election!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.820
We'll be cheering for you!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.480
Oh, thank you.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.350
Those of you here for the information
session, please come in.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:24.730
Oh, yes.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.360
Pardon me. Would you mind letting us through?

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.870
Oh, Toko.

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.210
I need to talk to you.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.700
I'm sorry, but it'll have to wait until tomorrow.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:46.580
Tomorrow?

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:47.940
I'm in a hurry right now.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.910
All right. Tomorrow, then.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:54.960
You won't be absent tomorrow, will you?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.920
I'll be here.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:59.180
You're so distrustful.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.500
Now, the time has passed,

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.590
so with the three of you, we will
now close the pool of candidates.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:10.170
Since it ended up being just the three of us,

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.440
I guess nothing will be changing
at the Rose Mansion.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:13.600
Yes.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:14.470
Yeah.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.340
Now, please look at your printouts.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.550
We will first begin with an explanation
of what is written there,

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.520
plus some supplemental information from us...

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.190
The time is past already.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.380
Would you go check it out?

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:28.610
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:33.520
What's the matter?

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.130
I'm sorry. The deadline has passed.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.660
What's going on?

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.370
It seems there is one more person
who would like to run for election.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.030
Oh, I see.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.570
Hanae-san.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.940
Would it not be possible for
us to let this person in?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:54.740
What?!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.340
If you ladies are fine with it...

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.010
Let her through.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:04.890
Please come in.

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:12.630
Toko-chan!

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.570
Good day. Pardon the intrusion.

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.280
We will now resume the information session.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.680
Please look at the printouts in front of you.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.820
We will explain what is written there...

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:34.790
Why, Toko-chan?
We will explain what is written there...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.090
Why, Toko-chan?
...and also offer some supplemental
information ourselves.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:37.080
...and also offer some supplemental
information ourselves.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:41.360
Toko is running?!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.660
She never said a word about anything like that.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.630
I was surprised, too.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.460
Are you all right, Yumi-san?

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.000
Your printout is totally blank...

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.330
Y-Yeah...

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:55.110
Oh, really! Toko!

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.040
What is she thinking?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:59.880
Yes, I think this is where we should calm down...

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:03.870
...and try to consider what Toko is thinking.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.780
What do you think, Noriko-chan?

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:10.680
I want to hear your perspective, as her friend.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:13.680
To be a pest...

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.960
No, an act of spite, if you will...

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.620
Neither is a good way to phrase it,

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.200
but I think it does show a certain
awareness of Yumi-sama on her part.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.140
Because I offered her my rosary?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.770
Yumi-san, don't think that
you were wrong to do so.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:32.710
Besides, the election is a fair process.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:37.150
Toko-chan's candidacy cannot
be an undesirable thing.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.650
We can't know that.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.590
If Toko-chan gets elected,

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.250
it means one of us loses the race.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.530
Do you think it's all right to let
something like that happen?

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.470
But justice does not lie with us.

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:54.370
I'm not talking about what's just or not just!

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:58.370
I just don't want my good
friends to get split up!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.940
I know what you're trying to say.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.980
Sure, I'm probably being self-centered.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.310
I'm fine with that!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.020
But still,

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:12.880
don't you think emotional outbursts
still contain valuable truths?

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.160
Not everyone can be like you,

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.610
always speaking with consideration for others!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:34.070
I love this side of you, Yoshino-san.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.080
What?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.310
Shimako-san, what in the world?!

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:44.040
I hope we'll continue to clearly state
our opinions to each other.

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:48.280
Okay...

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:52.790
Certainly, it would be sad to split this trio up.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:53.950
Agreed.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.960
They'd probably make a nice trio of Lady Roses.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.500
Noriko-chan.

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:03.300
Is there anything else about
Toko-chan you can think of?

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.870
Nothing in particular...

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.810
Oh, according to our classmates...

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.300
She apparently wanted to be a Lady Rose.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.080
A Lady Rose?

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.570
Then she shouldn't have turned down Yumi-san.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:17.680
Yoshino.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.450
But I mean, if she hadn't,

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.020
she would've been in a position that's
close to the Rosa Chinensis.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.790
I wonder why she turned it down.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:28.020
Maybe she found the idea of being
my little sister that painful...

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.420
Toko does not hate you, Yumi-sama!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:37.100
Yes, Toko-chan may have her
own reasons for doing this.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.170
I suppose we'll have to wait
and see for a while with this.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.040
Yes.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.710
I wonder why Toko-chan decided to run...

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:56.610
Is that just how badly she
wants to become a Lady Rose?

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:01.050
Or is she unhappy with the current
student council in some way?

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:08.600
If it means fighting with Toko-chan,
maybe my candidacy...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:17.980
Did you hear about Matsudaira Toko-san
of Year 1, Camellia Class?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.410
Surprising, isn't it?

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.780
The Lady Roses must find it troubling, too...

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.310
I would imagine so.

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:27.620
Matsudaira-san, we heard that you're
running for student council?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.480
Is there a problem with that?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.170
Why?

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.500
What do you mean "why"?

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.070
A lot has happened between Christmas and now,

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:46.040
but isn't it actually all about one thing?

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.680
You say such complicated things sometimes.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.040
Toko doesn't understand.

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.240
Don't make a joke of it.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:55.940
Well...

00:10:56.480 --> 00:11:00.320
But assuming that it's as you say,

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:03.850
do I owe it to you to give you the answer?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.190
What?

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:09.190
Must I tell you everything,
just because we're friends?

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.460
You're right.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:16.630
I'm going.

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:20.640
I have to submit my candidacy
before the end of the lunch break.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:23.870
Toko.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.080
I like you, you know.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.780
I always want to be on your side.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:34.160
But in the election, I won't be able to do that.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.490
With all my heart,

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:38.260
I want my dear sister to become
a student council officer.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.290
So, I'm going to support my dear sister.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.320
That's a given.

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:48.130
I was happy that you called me a friend.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.200
How naively good-natured.

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.240
Not so much so that I am suitable for you...

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:04.210
Lillian Student Council Election Candidates

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.440
Yumi Fukuzawa Yoshino Shimazu
Fora Lillian where
there are always smiles A happy academy life!

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.220
Shimako Todo Toko Matsudaira
Indefatigable Assiduity A breath of fresh air
for the student council!

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:11.090
Toko Matsudaira
A breath of fresh air
for the student council!

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.230
Why the dull look?

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.620
Can you tell?

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:24.410
I've been following you since Year 1.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:27.070
You think you can fool these eyes?

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.740
I just don't understand Toko-chan very well.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.140
I don't understand her, either.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.180
She's always got a mask on anyway.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.350
A mask?

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:41.350
Don't you feel it sometimes?

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.620
I do.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:50.090
You see, I think your good quality is
how you always show your true face.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:50.930
What?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.590
You're a poor actress.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.540
Still, I love that about you.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.740
But, do you think an amateur like you...

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:01.110
...can stand on the same stage
as a great actress and win?

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.780
By that,

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.110
do you mean that even if
I try to understand Toko-chan,

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:07.050
it'll be an impossible task for me?

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:08.780
As you currently are, yes.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.250
When your opponent has a mask on,

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:15.210
defenselessly showing your true
face isn't going to yield a victory.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:19.220
Oh, by "victory," I'm not
talking about the election.

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:20.720
Right.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.750
Thanks for the advice.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.200
Rather than words of thanks...

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.730
One photo!

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:31.840
Come on, over here.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.110
Got it? Cheerfully chat with me...

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.170
...and take a good look inside the classroom.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.080
This is Toko-chan's...

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.550
Just look.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:46.810
We'll talk afterwards.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.320
And Rei-chan was just awful.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.660
I told her not to let go yet,
but she let go right away.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.900
We're talking about my first
attempt at riding a bike here!

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.330
She could've been more mindful...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.300
Oh, but up until about 10 years ago,

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:01.370
I could ride just fine.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.030
It was with training wheels, but...

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:05.900
Well?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.040
Well what?

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:10.010
Everything's normal. The same as always.

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.840
Isn't that strange?

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:14.480
When we're in the midst of an election?

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.890
Yumi-sama? Yoshino-sama?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.590
Now that you mention it,

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.290
our class has shown no signs
of supporting Toko...

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.560
Right?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.490
It seems awfully normal.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.500
Does that mean...

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.440
Toko is partly to blame, too.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:40.500
Even when talk turns to the election,
she'll ignore it or disappear.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.540
It's no wonder she has no support.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.370
Yeah.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.640
I wonder if Toko-chan's all right...

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:01.260
Um, if you would like, I can show you the way.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.760
Oh my, that would be a great help.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:07.170
I actually came to deliver something
my daughter forgot at home,

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.860
but I'm unsure of my way around.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:12.230
Which class is your daughter in?

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.430
Year 1...

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:17.170
Oh, no, would you please take
me to the faculty office?

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.280
Pardon?

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.380
If your mother were to deliver
something you'd forgotten,

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.720
I think you might not like it to be
done in front of your friends.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.080
I understand perfectly.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.560
Lillian Girls' Academy
High School
Student Council
Officer Election

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:36.190
Lillian Girls' Academy
High School
Student Council
Officer Election
"Student Council Officer Election." Oh!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.600
Were you aware of it?

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:41.830
Yes, I have heard about it from my daughter.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:46.440
I hear those up for election this year
are the incumbent Rosa Gigantea,

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:50.400
the Rosa Foetida en bouton,
and the Rosa Chinensis en bouton.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:53.370
It seems my daughter is cheering for all of them.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:56.750
She says they're all wonderful dear sisters,

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.950
so they're sure to win.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:00.890
Isn't that splendid?

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:08.260
Toko, could I have a minute?

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.030
Why are you wearing those?

